  {
    "abstract": "AES3 provides for the serial digital transmission of two channels of periodically sampled and uniformly quantized audio signals on various media.\nThis Part specifies the semantics of the audio data, including the \"validity\" flag. It also specifies the sampling frequency by reference to AES5, AES recommended practice for professional digital audio - Preferred sampling frequencies for applications employing pulse-code modulation.",
