    "abstract": "AES3 provides for the serial digital transmission of two channels of periodically sampled and uniformly quantized audio signals on various media.\nThis Part specifies the information transmitted with the audio data: principally the \"channel status\" but also user data and the use of the auxiliary bits to carry a co-ordination signal. It incorporates Amendments 5 & 6.",
