  {
    "abstract": "AES3 provides for the serial digital transmission of two channels of periodically sampled and uniformly quantized audio signals on various media.\nThis Part specifies the physical signals that convey the bit stream specified in Part 3. The current version covers electrical signals on twisted-pair and co-axial cables. Other media, including fibre optic, are under consideration.\nThe content of Annex D (Normative): \"Coaxial Transmission\" supersedes the information document AES-3id-2001 (r2006)",
